{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13205200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13205200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320520001:1":{"text":"好心的孩子，谢谢你们帮我找回这些羊，还有萨莎。","source_cn":"好心的孩子，谢谢你们帮我找回这些羊，还有萨莎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x562706C53DD65011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320520002:1":{"text":"不用谢！都是多亏了萨莎，我们才能找回这只老羊！","source_cn":"不用谢！都是多亏了萨莎，我们才能找回这只老羊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1034513C9273A06D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320520003:1":{"text":"是呀，萨莎又勇敢又聪明，似乎还能听懂我们说话呢！","source_cn":"是呀，萨莎又勇敢又聪明，似乎还能听懂我们说话呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD404D97C1229B435","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320520004:1":{"text":"能听懂你们说话……？","source_cn":"能听懂你们说话……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DCB5F6C36631442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320520005:1":{"text":"是啊，我们刚发现绵羊身上的铃铛消失了，萨莎就找到了掉在草丛里的铃铛。","source_cn":"是啊，我们刚发现绵羊身上的铃铛消失了，萨莎就找到了掉在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB919AF17411D7B86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320520006:1":{"text":"更重要的是……它似乎能听懂满满在夸它！","source_cn":"更重要的是……它似乎能听懂满满在夸它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F3FB6E6A746AB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320520007:1":{"text":"汪汪！","source_cn":"汪汪！<key:dialog31>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFCA941089521F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320520008:1":{"text":"哎呀，萨莎真是个好孩子，大家都在夸你呢。","source_cn":"哎呀，萨莎真是个好孩子，大家都在夸你呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3E07E9FEAC148E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320520009:1":{"text":"说实话，萨莎经常帮我做这种小事，就像是拿一下拐杖、捡个铃铛。哈哈，说不定已经锻炼出来了？","source_cn":"说实话，萨莎经常帮我做这种小事，就像是拿一下拐杖、捡个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC068DE2263C87478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320520010:1":{"text":"也是多亏了有它在，放牧的工作轻松了不少呢！要不然，光是把羊赶回家这么一件事，就能把我累得气喘吁吁的。","source_cn":"也是多亏了有它在，放牧的工作轻松了不少呢！要不然，光是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5C821C26A5B4EE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320520011:1":{"text":"就是可惜，萨莎每天都要陪我放牧，没办法让它像其他小狗那样，自由自在地奔跑……","source_cn":"就是可惜，萨莎每天都要陪我放牧，没办法让它像其他小狗那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72ECBCBACD684A4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320520012:1":{"text":"才不是这样呢！能每天都陪在主人身边，这才是萨莎最大的幸福！","source_cn":"才不是这样呢！能每天都陪在主人身边，这才是萨莎最大的幸福！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78BD5A3CCB42EED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320520013:1":{"text":"没错，满满也是这样想的！\n萨莎，你说对不对？","source_cn":"没错，满满也是这样想的！\\n萨莎，你说对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1E06236DCEAAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320520014:1":{"text":"——汪！","source_cn":"——汪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE44661C88E66BB15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:牧民雅科夫":{"text":"牧民雅科夫","source":"牧民雅科夫","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"},"speaker:萨莎":{"text":"萨莎","source":"萨莎","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":4}}